OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 29 DEC
OL,4,G1700FWords and Music
OL,5,     GReadings by Jane Horrocks and Art
OL,6,     GMalik take us from Charlotte
OL,7,     GBronte to Hilaire Belloc and
OL,8,     GWilliam Blake, whilst musical
OL,9,     Gchoices evoke water mills, wind
OL,10,     Gmills and cotton mills.
OL,11,G1815FNew Generation Artists
OL,12,     GA Chopin scherzo from Alim
OL,13,     GBeisembayev, Mahler's Songs of a
OL,14,     GWayfarer from Niamh O'Sullivan
OL,15,     Gand a Brahms Violin Sonata from
OL,16,     GHana Chang and a new track from
OL,17,     Gjazz star Emma Rawicz.
OL,18,G1925FBBC Proms 2025
OL,19,     GJohn Wilson conducts Sinfonia of
OL,20,     GLondon in music by Strauss,
OL,21,     GBernstein and Ravel.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
