OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 29 DEC
OL,4,G2115FThe Lebrecht Interview
OL,5,     GNorman Lebrecht talks to New
OL,6,     GZealand opera star Dame Kiri Te
OL,7,     GKanawa, who reminisces about her
OL,8,     Glife and career, including
OL,9,     Gsinging at the royal wedding in
OL,10,     G1981.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GThe keyboardist, producer and
OL,19,     GEzra Collective member takes us
OL,20,     Garound his record collection.
